            "text": "<p>Here’s all you need to know about how we get our masks to you.</p><p></p><h2><strong>Shipping times</strong></h2><p>All orders are usually shipped within one (1) working day from order receipt and the delivery time depends on the shipping method you choose at checkout:</p><ol><li>Priority Mail Express® (1-2 days)</li><li>Priority Mail® (1-3 days)</li><li>First-Class Package Service® (1-3 days)</li><li>USPS Retail Ground® (2-8 days)</li></ol><p></p><h2><strong>Shipping Cost</strong></h2><p>Shipping costs are calculated at checkout and are based on the shipping method you chooset. We offer very competitive prices with USPS.</p><p></p><h2><strong>Order Tracking</strong></h2><p>You will receive a tracking number via email, which will enable you to trace the status of your order.</p>",
